// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P1469863370" "You really don't get the full Architect experience until you step back from the editor and try some of the missions others have made."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P491358781" "The key is starting small. Don't try to build something epic right off the bat. <em=no> I made that mistake myself and was in over my head before I knew it."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P548281828" "The only way to learn the ins and outs of Architect is to just dive in and explore the tools to their fullest."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P4216315993" "Did you know you can customize bosses or even have custom sidekicks? How cool is that!"
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P1071949291" "The Architect automatically checks your missions for errors in real time. It's pretty advanced."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P3571179142" "There are Architect buildings in nearly every island in the Rogue Isles, except Grandville. Lord Recluse doesn't seem to like Architect much."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P2353150563" "Be careful of what enemy groups you use, that will determine what level your players will be set to."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P1674312144" "You can save as many story arcs as you want, but you can only have three published at a time."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P4087001421" "Always make sure to test a mission before publishing it."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P194726862" "Try not to make your story too complex, your players still need to be able to follow it."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P3638234133" "You can change the pacing of your missions to mix up the difficulty."
// V_ARCHITECT_ADVICE_CHATTER :
"P4042594003" "Don't hate the players, you want to make sure they have fun in your missions."

// V_ARCHITECT_VIOLENCE :
"P1853471709" "Get back up, I dare ya."
// V_ARCHITECT_VIOLENCE :
"P1527196689" "Thank you so much for your 'constructive criticism,' you've given me a lot to think about. Punk."
// V_ARCHITECT_VIOLENCE :
"P2660735502" "You gave my mission one lousy star?!? How many stars you seeing now, loser?"
// V_ARCHITECT_VIOLENCE :
"P1359824" "Lord Recluse is most displeased with the depiction of him in your mission."

// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P2629832730" "This is the third time my mission 'Mynx's Furry Adventure' was rejected for violating the terms of service."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3094424856" "It looked so real! It all seemed so real!"
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P1020335411" "They say that Architect is perfectly safe, but my jaw still hurts from that time the Back Alley Bonehead sucker-punched me."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3827930006" "Real life would be so much more fun if it was in the Architect."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P2264292415" "I don't get it, no one likes my missions. Maybe they're too easy."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P493611410" "Man, people around here are whimps, saying my missions are too hard. What a bunch of crybabies."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P504915196" "Rumor has it Lord Recluse started Architect as a training tool for potential recruits."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3463276096" "You think Arachnos will mind if I use them as the villains in my mission? I've heard Lord Recluse takes a dim view of stuff like that."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P2715474524" "I mugged this guy on the way in and took his access codes. Can't wait to see what kind of stuff he's created in Architect."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3315444694" "I wish I could see some of the missions they're making over in Paragon City. Probably all about puppy dogs and rainbows and lame stuff like that."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P1722878018" "I put a lot of Freedom Corps jerks in my missions just so I can pound the snot out of them. It's cathartic."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P1020428673" "Did you hear that Architect is actually a gateway to a dimension of infinite possibilities?"
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P1418540728" "You gotta try this Architect mission I just did. I was so intense."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P1232531670" "I plan on making missions based solely on historical events, except in mine the villains win."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P711082135" "I worked so hard on my mission arc. If it doesn't get an award I'm gong to burn the building down."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3669935389" "...and Statesman's all like, 'Don't hurt me,' and I'm like, 'Prepare to die, fool!' It was awesome."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P1050338403" "That was awesome, lets do it again!"
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P4073749763" "I hear there's a secret entrance into Architect that actually allows you to jump into other people's mission uninvited."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P3024273178" "Did you hear some guy got lost inside an Architect mission? He's supposedly still in there, mad as a hatter."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_CHATTER :
"P2579139035" "My therapist says that Architect is a great place for me to work out my anger issues."

// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_REPLY :
