// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_REPLY :
"P312917543" "Hm, that's interesting. Actually, wait, no it isn't."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_REPLY :
"P3934227331" "Oh yeah? Really?"
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_REPLY :
"P3392484261" "No way! Get out of town. No, I mean it, leave."
// V_ARCHITECT_FAN_REPLY :
